 "text": "Hey, good to have you here. How are you? That's exhausting. Split the goals into small daily or weekly goals, and reward yourself for meeting them. It works. Teach yourself new song week and listen to it every day. Talk to native speakers as much as you can. It should feel like fun, not work. If it feels like work, try something else. Teachers will correct mistakes, but the real correction happens when you use the language. Focus on that, and the grammar will come naturally. That's a great idea. Use one side for notes, and the other for words you want to learn.",
